    "Check ingredient labels as garlic powder is often used instead of fresh garlic",
    "Look for brands that use garlic-infused oil rather than garlic pieces",
    "Store-bought versions may vary significantly in garlic content",
    "Homemade versions allow better control of garlic amounts"
  ],
